1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Thirty-First Episode
The Kingdom of the Seas

15
00:02:08,061 --> 00:02:10,450
I like the sea,
because it is big!

16
00:02:35,261 --> 00:02:38,059
There is the little turtle
on the turtle's back!

17
00:02:38,101 --> 00:02:40,899
There is the turtle
on the big turtle's back!

18
00:02:40,941 --> 00:02:43,819
If Grandpa falls, they all fall!
Whoops!

19
00:02:43,861 --> 00:02:45,897
How cruel they are!

20
00:02:45,941 --> 00:02:48,819
Halt! Wait!
Why are you mistreating the turtles?

21
00:02:48,861 --> 00:02:51,534
What did they do wrong to you?
Leave them alone!

22
00:02:52,621 --> 00:02:57,411
What do you want, kid? Go away,
otherwise we'll mistreat you too!

23
00:02:58,221 --> 00:03:00,212
All right!

24
00:03:08,341 --> 00:03:11,492
This is the money earned
by guarding the sheep!

25
00:03:11,541 --> 00:03:14,180
I'm giving it to you,
but leave the turtles alone!

26
00:03:16,261 --> 00:03:18,855
It's only 10 copper!
Don't make fun of us!

27
00:03:20,901 --> 00:03:22,812
Take that!

28
00:03:33,581 --> 00:03:37,017
Bad boys, you shouldn't
mistreat a child.

29
00:03:37,061 --> 00:03:39,575
The turtle spoke!

30
00:03:39,621 --> 00:03:41,896
You shouldn't fight.

31
00:03:41,941 --> 00:03:46,253
Help! Let's run away!

32
00:03:49,261 --> 00:03:51,331
Thanks for the help.

33
00:03:52,021 --> 00:03:56,378
You don't have to thank me.
I tried to help you, it's true,

34
00:03:56,461 --> 00:03:59,134
but you gave me
a much greater help.

35
00:03:59,181 --> 00:04:02,059
We were looking for exactly
a kind person like you.

36
00:04:02,101 --> 00:04:04,740
- Do you want to help us?
- Help you?!

37
00:04:05,821 --> 00:04:08,858
Yes! Come with us, let's
go to the dragon's palace.

38
00:04:08,901 --> 00:04:12,257
To the dragon's palace?!
No! I don't want to come!

39
00:04:12,501 --> 00:04:16,210
What are you doing? I don't
know how to swim! Sapphire!

40
00:04:22,621 --> 00:04:24,577
Tink!

41
00:04:26,021 --> 00:04:29,013
Tink! Tink!

42
00:04:29,061 --> 00:04:32,019
- Can I go with you?
- I'm looking for Tink...

43
00:04:32,061 --> 00:04:34,256
...and I have no need
of you, Nylon!

44
00:04:34,301 --> 00:04:37,373
But I want to help you anyway!
Two people can search better, right?

45
00:04:39,901 --> 00:04:44,338
- Tink! Tink!
- Hey! Wait, please!

46
00:04:46,581 --> 00:04:48,572
I'm telling you again that
I don't know how to swim!

47
00:04:48,621 --> 00:04:51,010
If we go to the dragon's
palace, I'll drown!

48
00:04:51,061 --> 00:04:54,053
Please,
stay with us to help us!

49
00:04:54,741 --> 00:04:56,936
But the dragon's palace
is at the bottom of the sea!

50
00:04:56,981 --> 00:05:00,018
And I am afraid
of the depths of the sea!

51
00:05:26,301 --> 00:05:30,852
Ah, you're here, Tink! Get up!
Get up, please! We've arrived!

52
00:05:41,621 --> 00:05:43,418
Where am I?

53
00:05:45,821 --> 00:05:47,812
You're at the bottom of the sea!

54
00:05:47,861 --> 00:05:51,217
At the bottom of the sea?!
But how come I haven't drowned?

55
00:05:52,341 --> 00:05:54,901
Now let's go
to the dragon's palace.

56
00:05:57,021 --> 00:05:59,740
My mother and my grandfather
are waiting for us.

57
00:06:01,221 --> 00:06:03,576
And Princess Neptune is there too

58
00:06:03,621 --> 00:06:05,691
Who is Princess Neptune?

59
00:06:05,741 --> 00:06:07,732
She's our Princess

60
00:06:22,100 --> 00:06:24,410
There are sharks! Let's run away!

61
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:35,011
Wait a moment!

62
00:06:35,300 --> 00:06:37,417
I think I hear..

63
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:40,453
Yes, there's a ship
passing above us.

64
00:06:42,940 --> 00:06:46,092
Pull it down, so I can
eat some pastries!

65
00:06:46,140 --> 00:06:48,496
I'm fed up with the food
at the dragon's palace.

66
00:06:48,540 --> 00:06:50,611
It's bad and too wet!

67
00:06:53,020 --> 00:06:55,296
Hey, you, little turtle!

68
00:06:55,700 --> 00:06:58,010
- What is it?
- Who is that funny little boy..

69
00:06:58,060 --> 00:07:00,620
...who is with you?
- He's a guest of mine.

70
00:07:02,100 --> 00:07:04,615
A guest? Give him to me!

71
00:07:04,660 --> 00:07:06,891
- No, I won't give it to you!
- Shut up!

72
00:07:07,460 --> 00:07:09,611
It's really very funny...

73
00:07:11,100 --> 00:07:14,218
I'll put it
in my little private zoo!

74
00:07:14,260 --> 00:07:16,092
- Give it to me!
- No!

75
00:07:18,020 --> 00:07:19,739
Wait!

76
00:07:32,100 --> 00:07:34,012
Let's duck in here!

77
00:07:34,060 --> 00:07:37,019
What a racket!
One can't get any sleep!

78
00:07:39,740 --> 00:07:43,620
Hey, you, big head! Have you hidden
someone in that big mouth of yours?

79
00:07:44,620 --> 00:07:47,658
Let me see!
Open this sort of trapdoor!

80
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:55,014
My henchmen managed
to pull down the ship.

81
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:58,215
Good job! Quite a nice haul!

82
00:07:59,020 --> 00:08:03,014
Tasty pastries...! Hey,
where are you going?

83
00:08:03,300 --> 00:08:06,054
To look for a quieter
little spot!

84
00:08:06,100 --> 00:08:09,696
I really want to see
if I can manage to take a nap.

85
00:08:11,420 --> 00:08:14,254
- Let us out! Let us out!
- Dammit!

86
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:17,498
- Can I just know what...?!
- Let us out! Let us out!

87
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:20,817
You're giving me
a stomachache!

88
00:08:22,380 --> 00:08:25,657
Thank you! You saved our lives!

89
00:08:26,420 --> 00:08:28,412
But who are those two?

90
00:08:28,460 --> 00:08:30,895
Now we are going
to the Dragon Palace.

91
00:08:48,701 --> 00:08:52,455
The Dragon Palace is cursed.
Right?

92
00:08:52,501 --> 00:08:54,617
In the past it was very beautiful,

93
00:08:54,661 --> 00:08:57,255
then the sharks destroyed it
almost completely.

94
00:09:02,101 --> 00:09:05,457
King Neptune, I've brought a guest!

95
00:09:05,501 --> 00:09:07,617
King Neptune!

96
00:09:08,221 --> 00:09:10,496
King Neptune!

97
00:09:15,821 --> 00:09:19,450
Hey, you, don't shout!
Or the palace will collapse!

98
00:09:20,421 --> 00:09:22,412
You've arrived, finally.

99
00:09:23,021 --> 00:09:27,014
Yes, I'm here! And now you'll tell me
what I have to do to help you.

100
00:09:27,061 --> 00:09:30,292
We brought you here
to help Princess Neptune.

101
00:09:30,741 --> 00:09:34,017
The Princess?!
She's King Neptune's daughter, right?

102
00:09:34,061 --> 00:09:36,017
Where is she? I want to see her!

103
00:09:36,061 --> 00:09:38,416
Princess Neptune
is no longer here.

104
00:09:38,501 --> 00:09:41,140
- Is she dead?
- No, she's not dead

105
00:09:41,181 --> 00:09:43,172
- But...
- "But", what?

106
00:09:48,021 --> 00:09:51,411
I am King Neptune.
Welcome to the dragon palace.

107
00:09:51,461 --> 00:09:54,214
You are a child
with a kind heart, right?

108
00:09:54,261 --> 00:09:56,217
My name is Tink.

109
00:09:56,701 --> 00:09:58,896
Tink? What a strange name!

110
00:09:58,941 --> 00:10:02,013
You seem different
from ordinary people.

111
00:10:02,221 --> 00:10:05,179
You see,
I am not a human being.

112
00:10:05,221 --> 00:10:07,530
I am an angel!
Do you know of angels?

113
00:10:07,581 --> 00:10:10,049
An angel?! Oh, heavens!

114
00:10:10,101 --> 00:10:12,820
Please, Mr. Angel Tink,
help my daughter,

115
00:10:12,861 --> 00:10:15,580
Princess Neptune! Please!

116
00:10:15,901 --> 00:10:18,813
What happened
to Princess Neptune?

117
00:10:18,861 --> 00:10:21,136
Come with me,
Mr. Angel Tink.

118
00:10:36,821 --> 00:10:38,812
Come, let's go forward

119
00:10:46,221 --> 00:10:49,019
Princess Neptune
is in here.

120
00:10:49,421 --> 00:10:51,810
Where? I don't see anything.

121
00:10:52,061 --> 00:10:55,212
Now I'll get you some light.
Lantern-fish!

122
00:10:56,341 --> 00:10:58,536
Here I am, I'm here!

123
00:10:58,581 --> 00:11:01,175
Light the lantern, please.

124
00:11:04,221 --> 00:11:07,213
How big this shell is!

125
00:11:07,261 --> 00:11:11,095
Princess Neptune shut herself
in there four years ago...

126
00:11:11,141 --> 00:11:13,609
...and hasn't wanted to come out since.
- Four years?!

127
00:11:13,661 --> 00:11:15,538
And why did she lock herself away?

128
00:11:15,581 --> 00:11:18,618
Oh, a bad thing happened
four years ago.

129
00:11:18,661 --> 00:11:21,494
Since then, no one has
managed to get her to come out.

130
00:11:21,541 --> 00:11:24,578
Mr. Angel Tink, please,
you make her come out!

131
00:11:26,221 --> 00:11:30,373
Shell! Shell, please,
open up! Please, shell!

132
00:11:34,621 --> 00:11:36,418
It's opening!

133
00:11:38,501 --> 00:11:42,414
Please, open up, shell!
Let the Princess out!

134
00:11:42,621 --> 00:11:47,012
It's closing again! Princess
Neptune, don't close!

135
00:11:47,061 --> 00:11:49,734
Shell! Shell! please, open up!

136
00:11:49,781 --> 00:11:53,012
King Neptune wants so
much to see Princess Neptune!

137
00:11:53,061 --> 00:11:56,053
He feels so lonely without
her! Please, open up!

138
00:11:56,101 --> 00:11:58,740
Princess, come out!

139
00:12:04,021 --> 00:12:08,617
She's coming out! We've waited
for you so long, Princess Neptune!

140
00:12:11,741 --> 00:12:15,450
No! Princess Neptune,
why won't you come out?

141
00:12:16,581 --> 00:12:19,334
- Why did you come?
- Why are you meddling?

142
00:12:19,541 --> 00:12:21,259
Go away!

143
00:12:21,781 --> 00:12:23,499
Shut up!

144
00:12:31,181 --> 00:12:33,570
But where did he go?

145
00:12:35,181 --> 00:12:39,254
We need Sapphire! Without
her, I can't do anything!

146
00:12:41,621 --> 00:12:44,613
Tink! Tink!

147
00:12:48,021 --> 00:12:50,012
Him again!

148
00:12:50,061 --> 00:12:53,258
Do you really not want me to
help you find your little friend?

149
00:12:53,301 --> 00:12:56,099
I'm very skilled at
finding things, you know?

150
00:12:56,141 --> 00:12:58,814
I don't need you!
And stop following me!

151
00:13:00,141 --> 00:13:02,496
While I am following you,
it will certainly happen...

152
00:13:02,541 --> 00:13:06,216
...the opportunity to kill
you! I am very stubborn!

153
00:13:06,541 --> 00:13:11,410
I will find a way to cut off
that beautiful little head!

154
00:13:12,341 --> 00:13:15,219
What?! Tink was
kidnapped by the turtles?

155
00:13:15,301 --> 00:13:17,895
Yes! He went out to
sea together with them.

156
00:13:18,101 --> 00:13:20,012
Oh, Tink..!

157
00:13:25,221 --> 00:13:28,657
Princess Sapphire, where are you
going with such a fragile little boat?

158
00:13:28,861 --> 00:13:31,170
- I'm going to look for Tink!
- What?!

159
00:13:32,221 --> 00:13:35,338
Tink! Tink!

160
00:13:37,941 --> 00:13:40,171
It's a gift from heaven!
With that wretched boat...

161
00:13:40,221 --> 00:13:42,496
...she will drown before she
manages to reach the open sea!

162
00:13:43,341 --> 00:13:45,730
Now Sapphire will
die! How happy I am!

163
00:13:46,421 --> 00:13:48,298
Tink!

164
00:13:50,101 --> 00:13:52,092
Tink!

165
00:14:04,421 --> 00:14:06,855
Let me go! Let me go!

166
00:14:07,381 --> 00:14:10,691
King Shark, you promised
me not to use violence!

167
00:14:10,741 --> 00:14:13,460
Ah, but you haven't
kept your promise either!

168
00:14:13,901 --> 00:14:16,654
I will keep it! This
time I will keep it!

169
00:14:16,701 --> 00:14:19,340
Really? Then you will give
me your daughter as a wife...

170
00:14:19,381 --> 00:14:21,895
..as you promised
four years ago?

171
00:14:22,421 --> 00:14:24,218
As a wife?!

172
00:14:25,261 --> 00:14:26,899
Well, yes, I...

173
00:14:27,061 --> 00:14:30,337
I love Princess Neptune!
But when will she come out?

174
00:14:30,821 --> 00:14:34,131
- Today.
- I can no longer trust you.

175
00:14:34,181 --> 00:14:37,412
You know, I've waited for her
for four very long years!

176
00:14:37,501 --> 00:14:41,380
And... I can't wait any longer!

177
00:14:41,581 --> 00:14:45,256
Wait, please! I will manage
to get her to come out, so wait!

178
00:14:45,301 --> 00:14:48,099
Alright, I will wait for a
little longer, but hurry up!

179
00:14:48,141 --> 00:14:49,813
Understood?!

180
00:14:51,741 --> 00:14:55,495
Mr. Angel Tink, please,
make the Princess come out!

181
00:14:55,541 --> 00:14:58,055
No! I will never allow
him to marry her! Never!

182
00:14:58,901 --> 00:15:01,051
Mr. Tink, please!

183
00:15:01,101 --> 00:15:03,695
Princess Neptune!
Princess Neptune!

184
00:15:03,741 --> 00:15:07,211
Did you hide there because you
didn't want to marry King Shark?

185
00:15:07,421 --> 00:15:10,572
- Yes! But who are you?
- I am Tink, Princess!

186
00:15:10,621 --> 00:15:13,579
Don't worry,
I will try to protect you!

187
00:15:14,341 --> 00:15:16,775
Mr. Tink,
I must keep the promise,

188
00:15:16,821 --> 00:15:18,812
even if it's an old promise.

189
00:15:18,861 --> 00:15:21,136
Why did you make
such a promise?

190
00:15:21,181 --> 00:15:23,411
To put an end to the violence
of King Shark.

191
00:15:23,461 --> 00:15:26,021
He told me that if I gave
him my daughter in marriage,

192
00:15:26,061 --> 00:15:28,621
he would stop tyrannizing
the weaker fish.

193
00:15:28,661 --> 00:15:31,221
I will not allow the shell
to open!

194
00:15:31,341 --> 00:15:34,139
Mr. Tink, it was
to protect the weak fish.

195
00:15:34,181 --> 00:15:36,058
Please, try to understand!

196
00:15:36,101 --> 00:15:38,695
Turtles,
let's all protect the Princess!

197
00:15:38,741 --> 00:15:41,209
If we unite,
we won't be eaten by the sharks!

198
00:15:41,261 --> 00:15:43,491
It's true! It's true! Let's unite!

199
00:15:43,541 --> 00:15:46,851
You don't know the cruelty
of King Shark.

200
00:15:47,781 --> 00:15:50,170
A ship is passing, I can feel it

201
00:15:50,221 --> 00:15:54,294
Pull down that ship
and bring me whoever is on board!

202
00:15:56,021 --> 00:15:59,058
Tink! Tink!

203
00:16:00,501 --> 00:16:03,493
Let's hope he hasn't drowned
and that he is still alive!

204
00:16:06,221 --> 00:16:07,620
My God!

205
00:16:33,821 --> 00:16:36,335
Well done! You've done
a really good job!

206
00:16:36,421 --> 00:16:40,130
This is the pill of oblivion. You
will take it, so you will forget everything

207
00:16:40,181 --> 00:16:42,615
.and you will do what I tell you!

208
00:16:45,701 --> 00:16:48,295
That's fine.
Let's go, now.

209
00:16:53,581 --> 00:16:56,141
Now bring me some clothes

210
00:16:59,421 --> 00:17:02,493
Go and put on one
of these dresses! Quickly!

211
00:17:12,181 --> 00:17:14,012
Sapphire?!

212
00:17:14,061 --> 00:17:16,177
I want to show it
to Princess Neptune.

213
00:17:16,221 --> 00:17:18,496
After four years,
she must be dressed out of fashion!

214
00:17:37,141 --> 00:17:40,497
Now spread all the clothes
on the stage!

215
00:17:45,621 --> 00:17:48,010
Open that shell!

216
00:17:50,741 --> 00:17:53,460
Up! Lift it!

217
00:18:02,461 --> 00:18:05,259
Sapphire, I'm happy to see you!
Listen...

218
00:18:05,421 --> 00:18:07,412
Listen, Sapphire..

219
00:18:07,461 --> 00:18:09,816
. Who are you? What do you
want from me? I don't know you!

220
00:18:10,141 --> 00:18:11,813
What?!

221
00:18:13,781 --> 00:18:16,534
Sapphire! Sapphire, let me out!

222
00:18:16,581 --> 00:18:20,096
It's Tink! Sapphire! Sapphire!

223
00:18:20,341 --> 00:18:22,411
Mr. Tink!

224
00:18:22,581 --> 00:18:25,573
King Neptune, let's fight
against the Shark King...

225
00:18:25,621 --> 00:18:27,577
...together with the other fish!

226
00:18:27,621 --> 00:18:31,091
We can't fight against
him! He's too strong!

227
00:18:31,141 --> 00:18:33,530
He's a bully! He'll kill us all!

228
00:18:34,461 --> 00:18:36,292
Oh, Tink!

229
00:18:39,741 --> 00:18:43,859
- Princess Neptune!
- Let's celebrate the wedding right away!

230
00:18:43,901 --> 00:18:46,893
If you marry her, will
you stop being so violent?

231
00:18:46,941 --> 00:18:49,171
I really don't know!

232
00:18:50,101 --> 00:18:52,251
- My father!
- My daughter!

233
00:18:58,021 --> 00:19:00,455
Do you want to tell me what
happened to you, Sapphire?

234
00:19:00,541 --> 00:19:02,816
I don't know, I don't remember anything!

235
00:19:02,861 --> 00:19:06,092
But what are you saying? Is it
possible you don't remember me?

236
00:19:06,141 --> 00:19:09,497
I am Tink! Turn
around! And look at me!

237
00:19:12,661 --> 00:19:14,413
And what is this?

238
00:19:15,821 --> 00:19:18,813
Tink, why are we in
this place? Tell me, why?

239
00:19:25,101 --> 00:19:27,740
There, it's open!
Now let's hurry!

240
00:19:32,341 --> 00:19:34,332
She's here! She's crying!

241
00:19:45,061 --> 00:19:46,699
Be quiet!

242
00:20:06,021 --> 00:20:09,730
Look, the bride is coming!

243
00:20:14,021 --> 00:20:16,171
Now let's begin!

244
00:20:19,301 --> 00:20:23,817
King Shark, do you swear that you
will make Princess Neptune your wife...

245
00:20:23,861 --> 00:20:26,011
..and abolish forever violence?

246
00:20:26,061 --> 00:20:28,211
Well, yes, I swear it!

247
00:20:29,261 --> 00:20:32,094
And you, Princess Neptune,
even if you wouldn't want to...

248
00:20:32,141 --> 00:20:35,656
...be the bride of King
Shark, do you swear anyway...

249
00:20:35,701 --> 00:20:39,330
...to put up with him and to
live together with him peacefully?

250
00:20:40,501 --> 00:20:43,413
Well, what's gotten into you now?!
Do you want to swear it or not?

251
00:20:44,381 --> 00:20:47,691
Answer now, otherwise I'll
get angry right away, you know?

252
00:20:47,741 --> 00:20:49,732
Please, swear it! Please!

253
00:20:49,781 --> 00:20:52,739
Swear, or else...
And who are you?!

254
00:21:08,181 --> 00:21:10,695
Go, Sapphire! Defeat them!

255
00:21:12,621 --> 00:21:17,172
Before we were weak, but now
that we are united, we are strong!

256
00:21:29,901 --> 00:21:32,540
Come on, get them!

257
00:21:36,101 --> 00:21:38,057
Well done! Well done!

258
00:21:45,221 --> 00:21:47,735
Shell, please, open up!

259
00:22:00,021 --> 00:22:02,899
We won! We won!

260
00:22:03,541 --> 00:22:05,896
- Mr. Tink!
- We won!

261
00:22:05,941 --> 00:22:08,296
Hurray! We won! Hurray!

262
00:22:15,541 --> 00:22:18,294
Thank you, Sapphire! And
thank you too, Tink!

263
00:22:18,421 --> 00:22:22,050
What a pity I couldn't fight too!

264
00:22:22,821 --> 00:22:25,130
- What’s happening, Sapphire?
- Damn it!

265
00:22:25,181 --> 00:22:28,457
I just remembered now that
one day in the dragon's palace...

266
00:22:28,501 --> 00:22:31,698
...corresponds to 50 years
in the human world! Right?

267
00:22:32,221 --> 00:22:35,577
My God, then we must
go back as soon as possible!

268
00:22:35,621 --> 00:22:38,738
Please, wait, Sapphire.
They say that this box...

269
00:22:38,781 --> 00:22:41,500
...grants wishes. Open it
when you are in trouble.

270
00:22:43,701 --> 00:22:45,817
Goodbye! Goodbye!

271
00:22:45,861 --> 00:22:48,329
- Goodbye!
- Goodbye!

272
00:22:53,141 --> 00:22:55,132
I can't wait to get there.

273
00:22:55,181 --> 00:22:57,649
I wonder if our friends have
already become old people...

274
00:23:09,301 --> 00:23:13,089
It's Nylon! What happened to him?
He seems to have turned to stone!

275
00:23:17,021 --> 00:23:20,650
I'm scared! I wonder what
happened...! Let's try to open the box!

276
00:23:20,701 --> 00:23:22,896
What will happen when we open it?

277
00:23:22,941 --> 00:23:25,375
We could become an old
man and an old woman.

278
00:23:25,421 --> 00:23:27,252
I don't want to become an old man!

279
00:23:34,861 --> 00:23:37,659
We haven't changed! Thank goodness!

280
00:23:43,461 --> 00:23:46,453
It's a gift from heaven!
Sapphire must have drowned!

281
00:23:47,181 --> 00:23:49,172
I'm so happy!

282
00:23:49,621 --> 00:23:52,374
Hey! I thought you were both dead!

283
00:23:52,421 --> 00:23:54,412
What happened instead?

284
00:23:57,941 --> 00:24:00,091
Nothing strange happened.

285
00:24:00,141 --> 00:24:03,417
I had asked the Gods of heaven to stop time in the world,

286
00:24:03,461 --> 00:24:06,294
while you were helping me.
Now that the box is open,

287
00:24:06,341 --> 00:24:08,730
time has started to pass again.

288
00:24:27,501 --> 00:24:31,121
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

289
00:24:31,122 --> 00:24:34,482
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

290
00:24:34,483 --> 00:24:38,253
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

291
00:24:38,254 --> 00:24:41,415
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

292
00:24:41,416 --> 00:24:45,229
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

293
00:24:45,230 --> 00:24:48,526
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

294
00:24:48,527 --> 00:24:52,532
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

295
00:24:52,533 --> 00:24:55,971
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

296
